# Malamet Battle Glyph: "Choose target creature you control and target creature you don't control. If the creature you control
# entered this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on it. Then those creatures fight each other." On turn 3 Bot1 casts a Grizzly Bears and
# then the Glyph, choosing it and Bot2's Grizzly Bears (not Bot2's Memnite). The Bears entered this turn, so it gets the counter
# first (CR 608.2c) and is a 3/3: it deals 3 to Bot2's Bears, which dies, and takes 2 (CR 701.14a), surviving. Memnite is left alone.

